last_updated:           2026-10-02
source_event:           juk/26.04.0 OHOS adaptation: KIOWidgets/KIOFileWidgets requirement forced kio/6.14.0 (6.26.0 is KIOCORE_ONLY); kwindowsystem pinned to 6.26.0; zlib/1.3.2 chosen over 1.3.1 (PIC); Taglib::Taglib/ZLIB::ZLIB resolved by generate() wrappers; DocBook handbook chain and the X11-only KX11Extras include resolved by patches 0001/0002; final conan create green with test_package executing bin/juk.

